sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-dorudon-atrox-turing-wavelength-s0> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-dorudon-atrox-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-dorudon-atrox-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Dorudon atrox Turing wavelength at 253 µm, Priabonian 37.0 Ma (pass 2) — MorphoEval overall 87.6/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 closes the pass-1 gaps. With Du held at 406.13 µm², raising Dv/Du from 8 to 32 moves the fastest wavelength from 215.4 µm to 290.0 µm and sigma_max from -0.135 to 0.254. The critical ratio 11.657 sits at sigma ≈ 0. The slot ratio 15.970 has onset lambda_c = 253 µm exactly and fastest-mode lambda 251.3 µm. Plate azimuthal fit at that fixed k: Pearson r = 0.9918 against a polynomial-only baseline of 0.8198, RMSE 0.0154, KS 0.09. Equal-diffusion std(u) fell to 3.4e-13 while the slot run finished at std(u) = 0.066. Weighted overall 87.6. The GIF last frame scores 91.1 against the pattern plate and 79.6 against the Wadi El-Hitan fossil. Overall 87.6/100 (faithfulness 87.6, reproducibility 87.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 90, Morphological realism / specimen match 84, Parameter expressivity 88, Morphometric validation 90, Source and data traceability 88, Code-to-model traceability 84, Reproducibility package 90. Output judged: docs/media/dorudon_atrox_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-dorudon-atrox-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc, image/png, 415763 B, 1440×864 px, artifact_sha256 c6fd9d64ee42c555b59cc1e2680a02f52d2f23872cf0081160cfa3cb123e3454 (sha256 c6fd9d64ee42c555b59cc1e2680a02f52d2f23872cf0081160cfa3cb123e3454), spec_fingerprint 46aab34eb8903a5c5e8fe581a0d8a160edfd47f81ba888aafd43c512c489faac. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 46aab34eb8903a5c5e8fe581a0d8a160edfd47f81ba888aafd43c512c489faac; artifact_sha256: c6fd9d64ee42c555b59cc1e2680a02f52d2f23872cf0081160cfa3cb123e3454; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/dorudon_atrox_turing_wavelength_s0/dorudon_atrox_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=df3cab3ac71f7f45..., datasets/dorudon_atrox_turing_wavelength_s0/dorudon_atrox_turing_wavelength_s0_specimen.jpg=5a04e317b788950e..., datasets/dorudon_atrox_turing_wavelength_s0/dorudon_atrox_wadi_el_hitan.jpg=fdadd7e651f209ef...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-dorudon-atrox-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952 critical wavenumber | Murray 1981 coat pre-pattern | Kondo & Asai 1995 and Nakamasu et al. 2009 pigment-cell waves | Dorudon atrox as a Priabonian basilosaurid with a vestigial hindlimb (Uhen 2004, 2007; Gingerich et al. 1990); reconstructed_in_script: Schnakenberg parameters solved for lambda_c = 253 µm | Radial fit: degree-5 vignette plus J0(k), J0(2k), J0(3k) with k fixed by the 111 px = 100 µm bar | Domain scenario 8 → 3 → 0 wavelengths at 47 Ma, 37.0 Ma, and 0 Ma; transfer_boundary: No Dorudon integument is known. The gallery plate is an ocellus with a 100 µm bar, not a thin section.; does_not_claim: That the fossil skeleton is a Turing pattern | That the plate's secondary peak at 93.2 µm is the animal's wavelength | That 8, 3, and 0 are measured bud lengths." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: A second assessor from another provider has not scored this script.",
            "remediation needed: The 8/3/0 hindlimb counts remain a scenario. They are not measured Dorudon bud lengths.",
            "remediation needed: a and b are fixed; only Dv/Du and the domain mode count were exercised." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.876"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 (builder and assessor, single-agent cloud loop; no second assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "grok-4.7" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> .
}

